description: bun:test for unit/integration, MSW for HTTP stubs
globs: "**/*.{test,spec}.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Testing

Do not add Vitest or Jest.

- Unit/integration: `bun:test`, colocated `*.test.ts` / `*.test.tsx`. Use `mock()` from `bun:test`, not `vi.fn`.
- HTTP stubs: `@repo/mocks` (already started from `test/setup.ts`).
- Independent Settle Kit consumer smoke: `bun run smoke:settle-kit` (Chromium via Playwright; not an app e2e suite).
